IMPORT io

' bug-298: a resource `src`/`dst` glob in project.json may not escape the project
' root. The old guard split only on `/` and treated only a leading `/` as
' absolute, so `..` traversal (and Windows/backslash/absolute spellings) slipped
' through. path_stays_in_project now rejects any `..` component. This project's
' resource src `../outside/secret.conf` must be rejected at the build gate.
FUNC main AS Integer
  io::print("hi")
  RETURN 0
END FUNC
